function previewPachinkoBeep(p){if(p?.spinBeepEnabled===false){setStatus('回転中の音源はOFFです');return}if(!p?.spinBeepAudioUrl){setStatus('回転音の音源を選択してください');return}if(pachinkoBeepPreviewAudio){pachinkoBeepPreviewAudio.pause();pachinkoBeepPreviewAudio=null}const volume=clamp(p?.spinBeepVolume,0,100,35)/100;if(p?.spinBeepAudioUrl){pachinkoBeepPreviewAudio=new Audio(p.spinBeepAudioUrl);pachinkoBeepPreviewAudio.volume=volume;pachinkoBeepPreviewAudio.play().catch(()=>setStatus('ピープ音を試聴できませんでした'));return}const Ctx=window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext;if(!Ctx||volume<=0)return;try{pachinkoBeepPreviewContext=pachinkoBeepPreviewContext||new Ctx();if(pachinkoBeepPreviewContext.state==='suspended')pachinkoBeepPreviewContext.resume().catch(()=>{});const osc=pachinkoBeepPreviewContext.createOscillator(),gain=pachinkoBeepPreviewContext.createGain(),now=pachinkoBeepPreviewContext.currentTime;osc.type='sine';osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(880,now);gain.gain.setValueAtTime(.0001,now);gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(Math.max(.0002,volume*.12),now+.008);gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.0001,now+.085);osc.connect(gain);gain.connect(pachinkoBeepPreviewContext.destination);osc.start(now);osc.stop(now+.09)}catch(e){setStatus('ピープ音を試聴できませんでした')}}
